                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f \in [\mathbb{A}^1,\mathbb{A}^1](S) = S[T]
                  be an element. Then there exists a partition
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mn 1
                        %mo =
                        %msub
