            %p The third statement is immediate, localization is not even necessary.
          .num_remark
            %h6#remark Remark
            %p
              Since the big Zariski topos is
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cocomplete+category"} cocomplete
              (being a
              = succeed ")," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Grothendieck+topos"} Grothendieck topos
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/disjunction"} disjunction
              and refer to the object
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
