                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{A}^1[X]
              of internal polynomials: The canonical ring homomorphism
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
